    <date year="2013" month="July"/>
    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This document modifies the &quot;Unassigned&quot; number space in the IANA
&quot;OSPFv3 Instance ID Address Family Values&quot; registry by dividing it in
two halves -- one half Unassigned but managed via Standards Action,
and the other Reserved for Private Use.  It updates RFC 5838.</t>
    </abstract>
